{"version":1,"content":"<p>本港周三（10月28日）大致多雲，早晚有一兩陣雨，最低氣溫約24°C，日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約28°C。</p><p>吹和緩至清勁東風，離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p>隨後兩三日日間大致天晴及乾燥。</p><p>下周日（11月1日）雲量增多。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:01:37.337772+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:42:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T21:18:18.716605+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:58:30.246789+00:00","content_hash":"1d812d54f32052d037b97f247154ed8f46dd623ad945d69b8323c829ab1e4a57","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}